# NOTE: src/convex/_generated is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It must be committed so that "@/convex/_generated/api" resolves on hosts
# that build without running Convex codegen (e.g. Vercel). `convex codegen`
# also regenerates it during `build`, keeping it in sync.
